                    "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Track the configuration and CLI governed by this ruling**\n\nAdd `nexus.toml` and `nexus/cli.py` to this record's sources. The ruling explicitly forbids a price table in the runtime configuration and dollar output from `nexus usage`, but `freshness_errors()` currently reacts only to changes in `nexus/telemetry/usage.py`; either forbidden behavior can therefore be introduced while this canonical record remains stamped as current.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L44-L44](https://github.com/pythagorakase/nexus/blob/5830781bc1c46c4e6e33b1fef5105a291dee24e2/AGENTS.md#L44-L44)\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
